    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>Make a ranged touch attack. On a hit, the target takes 1d6 cold damage per caster level, maximum 10d6. A damaged creature must make a Fortitude save or become chilled for 1d4 rounds.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Attack and cold damage are automated; roll the chill duration and apply the chilled condition manually after a failed Fortitude save.</p>"
    },
